{"product_id":"berlitz-language-my-first-1000-words-english","title":"Berlitz Language: My First 1000 Words English","description":"\u003cp\u003eBerlitz My First 1000 Words In English Is Perfect For Children Aged 4 Years And Up Who Are Developing Their Vocabulary And Are Learning New Words. This Colourful, Illustrated Book Features A Thousand Words Depicted Through 27 Different Everyday Scenes To Help Children Build Their Vocabulary And Learn About New Things. Themes Include At The Zoo, At The Museum, On The Farm, The Body, Birthdays, Winter Sports, And More. Colourful Illustrations Depict Each Word And Fun Activities Help To Stimulate Your Child's Interest Further. To Enrich The Learning Experience, There Is A Let's Talk Talking Point At The End Of Each Entry That Provides A Springboard For Curious Minds To Start Conversations About The World Around Them.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 217 x 280\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Publications Services Staff APA\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9789812688132\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 64\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45675034804377,"sku":"BLK-49789812688132","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68a9ef84b56ba_Berlitz_Language-_My_First_1000_Words_English_Publications_Services_Staff_APA.jpg?v=1756279594","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/berlitz-language-my-first-1000-words-english","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}